# ==============================================================================
# Ustream Environment Variables Example
# ==============================================================================
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTICE:
# - API keys must ONLY be configured in Netlify environment variables or local .env.
# - NEVER commit your .env file or hardcode keys in frontend/client-side code.
# - Netlify setup: Site configuration -> Environment variables -> Add variable
#
# Required Environment Variable for Live MovieBox Streaming:
RAPIDAPI_KEY=your_rapidapi_key_here

# Alias recognized by both local server and Netlify function:
RAPID_API_KEY=your_rapidapi_key_here

# Local Development Server Port
PORT=4174

# RapidAPI Upstream Service Configuration
RAPID_API_BASE=https://moviebox-api.p.rapidapi.com
RAPID_API_HOST=moviebox-api.p.rapidapi.com
